  "name": "clinical-trial-rag",
  "description": "Grounded RAG microservice for clinical trial eligibility analysis: a FastAPI service that answers eligibility questions about trial protocols and pre-screens patient summaries against each criterion, with answers grounded in verbatim, verified protocol text. Built on LangChain, ChromaDB, sentence-transformers and Pydantic v2, running with OpenAI or locally via Ollama.",
